            "description": "true removes the member: soft delete (synced as UserRecord.deleted), all refresh tokens revoked, login blocked. Fails with 409 cannot_delete_self for the calling admin and 409 last_admin for the last admin. false is ignored (no undelete); a deleted user yields 404.",
